                ["On guard!" Sentri cries as he draws his sword. ^<v8> <v9> forced to respond with the most easily readied weapon <v8> <v10>. Without a word, Sentri advances upon <v11>, swinging his blade in a seemingly wild, yet entirely controlled manner. ^<v8> <v9> forced to block his blows to the best of <v12> ability. Luckily, Sentri stops just short of striking <v11>, which he is often able to do. Slowly but surely, over the course of the training session, <v12> blocking improves and <v8> <v13> to get in a few thrusts of <v12> own. ^<v12> agility improves, and the improvement is tangibly perceptible.];
                ["I enjoyed that!" Sentri exclaims after it is all over.*];
